Package: PRISM
Type: Package
Title: Partial Rho Identification through Scale Modeling: Robust Covariance Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Maxwell Konnaris, Michelle Nixon, and Justin Silverman
Maintainer: Maxwell Konnaris <Maxwellkonnaris@gmail.com>
Description: A package for running simulations and robust covariance analysis on count data using a bootstrap scale estimation approach to solve partially identified systems.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Imports: tidyverse, driver, rBeta2009, pbapply, progress, progressr, scales, utils, foreach, doSNOW, parallel, stats, MCMCpack, ggplot2, profvis, gridExtra, grid, dplyr, tidyr, coda, compositions, ggpairs
